<title>INDIA: SOCCER-UZBEKISTAN BEAT CHINA IN NEHRU CUP SEMIFINAL.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-UZBEKISTAN BEAT CHINA IN NEHRU CUP SEMIFINAL.</headline>
<dateline>COCHIN, India 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of a semifinal in the Nehru Gold Cup soccer tournament on Wednesday:</p>
<p> Uzbekistan    2    China     1  </p>
<p> (after extra time. score at 90 minutes 1-1. halftime   0-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Uzbekistan - Azizjon Khoshimov 85, Andrei Akopyants 110</p>
<p>China - Qui Zhong Hui 2</p>
</text>
